{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/Steam_Deco_Titre.png?t=1729342166\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After an exhausting day\u2026 You return home with your new shmup in hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black out! You wake up in the midst of a space battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to be one of the four pilots and hold the fate of this world in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/I_Got_Isekaid_Into_A_Shmup_GIF_Steam.gif?t=1729342166\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable for 1 to 4 players: Invite your friends for an intense cooperative experience! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Story Mode to experience the game's adventure through dialogue and comic-style introductions, or dive into Arcade Mode for uninterrupted action. Both modes feature three difficulty levels: Normal, Hard, and Manic.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Boss Rush Mode by completing the game! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 8 unique worlds, each with its own challenges and secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from 4 ships with varied shooting styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock bonus scenes to delve deeper into the story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and complete a mysterious bestiary. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim high with 45 unlockable achievements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against friends with scoreboards for each difficulty level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support screen rotations, play as you like. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And to top it all off, an epic soundtrack, fueled by custom-made instrumental metal! \ud83c\udfb6\ud83e\udd18 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to dive into the action, dodge tons of bullets, and save this world teetering on the edge of chaos! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/Steam_Deco01.png?t=1729342166\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870000/extras/Steam_Deco02.png?t=1729342166\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First kill!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/7dee912e6169f365d855a4f9f1f9148826b87595.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST SHIELD!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/5a1a6bf0d9fa34956c7583f4b3de3346595df529.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST CRYSTAL!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/0232e9b3799b8368b8785ac9ede2dbad742fd058.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870000/40b2a25833db5d9196c541494b85de41135144ea.jpg"},{"name":"BOSS 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai